    "compareAtPrice": null,
    "description": "<ul>\n    <li>FLEXIBLE SCREEN</li>\n    <li>BLACK+WHITE COLOR/GREY TUNES</li>\n  </ul>\n  <p>\n    IKI (いき, “chic, stylish”) is a concept in aesthetics, an expression of simplicity, sophistication, spontaneity and originality.\n    we+ar TRBL is a full ecosystem, consisting of an electronic device “IKI”, a compatible garment and a mobile app.\n    With this ultra-flat, lightweight 6.8’’ screen, you can share what you think, how you feel, who you love… on your T-shirt! Using Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) to interact with your smartphone, IKI can display slideshows of about 20 images that can be edited and enhanced with keywords or slogans via the TRBL app. Each shirt tells its own unique story.\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    Thanks to a dedicated Cloud, you can share content among the community, broadcast your creations to friends, or display ethical feeds from NGOs and third parties.\n  </p>\n  <p>\n    we+ar TRBL is the first social network on a garment, allowing you to be creative, original and to tell the world who and what you are!\n  </p>",
