      "description": "<ul> <li>GREY COLOR</li> <li>BLACK FRAME</li> <li>95% COTTON FLEECE</li> <li>5% METALLIC YARN</li> <li>MAGNETIC IKI POCKET</li> <li>SWEAT</li> </ul> <p><span>Obsidian black unisex sweat-shirt.</span><br><span>Fabrication of single and double knit jerseys and loop back knit.</span></p> <p><br><span>The seamless integration of the IKI screen into the garment is made through a technical textile progress which includes laser cut and heat welding with addition of a flexible metallic fiber tape. The tape is hear sealed to secure screen into the black frame and makes sure that the magnetic screen stays in shape, no matter how much you move.</span></p>",
